      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "HIGHLAND DANCER (4) is back after a 24-week spell. Appeared twice in the maiden prep for two placings, racing equally as well when taking a sit or leading. No trials leading into this but assume she is forward enough to pick up where she left off. MAGATAMA (6) last raced when she led but was swamped late and missed the placings over 1000m at Taree on 3 March. Recent trial winner who looks set to start her second campaign off in a positive manner. MY SWEETHEART (7) closed well for a distant third when second-up recently over 1007m at Taree. Should be competitive again at just the third run of the prep. FIOGGIA (9) did little on debut at Tamworth but is worth another chance with winkers on over a slightly longer trip. THE CRUSHER (10) didn't finish the race off on debut at Taree but is open to plenty of improvement.",
